{"id":2601,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><strong>《就业协议》解约公告</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p>下列毕业生向学校递交了“与原签约单位解约，要求换发新的《就业协议》”的书面申请。根据学校有关规定，与原签约单位解约，需在学校就业信息网上公示。自公示之日起3个工作日内无异议的，学校予以换发。如有异议，请与就业管理与服务办公室联系，联系电话：0351-3557211</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HLR7gsU4-DLRL8MLm98M46kUlrRMzNMaLzUaUlWfUmC4MmC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkLkyiMSysnN-bozQfMzG4LNCZUmM7nNUsnmAfoz78U46FnR6VL4T2oz6FLN7YL1baptveo4OeqtXbQDPZ_ShXptQ0g47aL4v0LmLbM4NJqdonx&oid=1280026481&tid=1037&nid=23979&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7B0557FB996A5032F8B3DFD7F8A914C7/D7E39F97/2A22\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HLR7gsU4-DLRL8MLm98M46kUlrRMzNMaLzUaUlWfUmC4MmC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkLkyiMSysnN-bozQfMzG4LNCZUmM7nNUsnmAfoz78U46FnR6VL4T2oz6FLN7YL1baptveo4OeqtXbQDPZ_ShXptQ0g47aL4v0LmLbM4NJqdonx&oid=1280026481&tid=1037&nid=23979&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HLR7gsU4-DLRL8MLm98M46kUlrRMzNMaLzUaUlWfUmC4MmC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkLkyiMSysnN-bozQfMzG4LNCZUmM7nNUsnmAfoz78U46FnR6VL4T2oz6FLN7YL1baptveo4OeqtXbQDPZ_ShXptQ0g47aL4v0LmLbM4NJqdonx&oid=1280026481&tid=1037&nid=23979&e=.png"}